    "sections": {
        "description": "Unseen Blog is a lightweight and customizable WordPress theme designed for bloggers, coaches, consultants, speakers, trainers, mentors, and small businesses. The theme provides a responsive layout with support for featured images, custom logos, custom menus, widget areas, threaded comments, RTL languages, and block editor styles. Unseen Blog is compatible with Gutenberg and supports popular page builders, including Elementor, Brizy, Beaver Builder, and Visual Composer. The theme also provides WooCommerce compatibility for websites that require e-commerce functionality. It includes customization options for colors, typography, branding, layouts, and other visual settings. The theme is translation-ready and designed to work across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices."
    },
